  preQuestDialogueLines:
  - So, you want to earn some money eh?
  - Well, fishing can be a great help.
  - I happen to need some Great Dingle Fish.
  - Head to the docks just behind you to find some.
  - If you bring me back 2 ill make it worth your while!
  postQuestDialogueLines:
  - Great job! Heres 5 bucks!
  - Fishing is a high skill trade around these parts. Im sure others also need some
    help!
